        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quarantined hospital. A hidden truth. A journalist trapped inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After breaking news reports that Tabuk Specialist Hospital has been placed under emergency quarantine following a mysterious incident, investigative journalist Khalid Salem receives an anonymous message.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Want the biggest story of your career? Come to the hospital. Now.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignoring every warning, Khalid sneaks inside, determined to uncover the truth before anyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minutes later...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every exit is sealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hospital is no longer a crime scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is still alive inside the quarantine zone, and it isn't willing to let anyone leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for clues, uncover the truth behind the outbreak, and fight to escape before you become the next headline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># GAMEPLAY OVERVIEW</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GeneBreak is a first-person survival horror experience built around tension, exploration, and resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hallway could hide danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no safe zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >## Limited Inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry only the essentials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage batteries, keys, fuses, and other critical items while making every inventory slot count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >## Unpredictable Creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infected don't behave like ordinary monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some wander.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some stalk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some wait in silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others will never stop hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >## Explore a Living Nightmare</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through abandoned hospital wards, operating rooms, laboratories, emergency departments, and dark maintenance corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every area hides new dangers—and another piece of the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >## Discover the Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover documents, recordings, and environmental clues that reveal what really happened before the hospital was sealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The darker the truth becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># KEY FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• First-person survival horror experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Play as investigative journalist Khalid Salem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Cinematic opening that sets the story in motion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Intelligent enemies with unpredictable behavior</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Exploration-focused gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Limited inventory and resource management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Environmental storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• No crafting system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• No hand-holding—only survival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Optimized for low and mid-range PCs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth is waiting inside the quarantine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only question is...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive long enough to uncover it?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quarantined hospital. A hidden truth. A journalist trapped inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After breaking news reports that Tabuk Specialist Hospital has been placed under emergency quarantine following a mysterious incident, investigative journalist Khalid Salem receives an anonymous message.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Want the biggest story of your career? Come to the hospital. Now.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignoring every warning, Khalid sneaks inside, determined to uncover the truth before anyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minutes later...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every exit is sealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hospital is no longer a crime scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is still alive inside the quarantine zone, and it isn't willing to let anyone leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for clues, uncover the truth behind the outbreak, and fight to escape before you become the next headline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># GAMEPLAY OVERVIEW</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GeneBreak is a first-person survival horror experience built around tension, exploration, and resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hallway could hide danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no safe zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >## Limited Inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry only the essentials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage batteries, keys, fuses, and other critical items while making every inventory slot count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >## Unpredictable Creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infected don't behave like ordinary monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some wander.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some stalk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some wait in silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others will never stop hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >## Explore a Living Nightmare</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through abandoned hospital wards, operating rooms, laboratories, emergency departments, and dark maintenance corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every area hides new dangers—and another piece of the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >## Discover the Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover documents, recordings, and environmental clues that reveal what really happened before the hospital was sealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The darker the truth becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># KEY FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• First-person survival horror experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Play as investigative journalist Khalid Salem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Cinematic opening that sets the story in motion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Intelligent enemies with unpredictable behavior</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Exploration-focused gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Limited inventory and resource management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Environmental storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• No crafting system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• No hand-holding—only survival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Optimized for low and mid-range PCs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth is waiting inside the quarantine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only question is...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive long enough to uncover it?</p>",
